(go/type ctxt0 "ctxt0 holds state while assembling a single function.\nEach function gets a fresh ctxt0.\nThis allows for multiple functions to be safely concurrently assembled.\n" (struct
    ^{:line 45 :tag (* obj/Link)} ctxt
